SUMMARY:Comedy at The Funk: Gus Tate
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best l
 ocal and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have NYC favorite Gu
 s Tate in The Cultura Room!\n\nGus Tate is a rising star in the New York c
 omedy scene\, known for his understated delivery\, unexpected punchlines\,
  and uncommon background: he’s a native Kentuckian who started his stand
 -up career in China. As a father to an ungovernable 7-year-old girl\, Gus
 ’s comedy appeals to tired men and insane women of all ages. In 2026 he 
 was named a New Face at the Just for Laughs festival in Montreal and appea
 red on the latest season of “Comics Unleashed with Byron Allen” on CBS
 . He has two comedy specials\, “Top Gus” (200k) and “Two Wrongs” (
 100k)\, both on YouTube.\n\nSeated show\, full dinner menu available\n\nag
 es 18+\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $18
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-comedy-fans/events/31740757
 6/
